version: 1.0

// @switch mixed-arm chain with a non-last `default:`. The codegen mixed-arm
// path folds the if-chain in reverse and a default arm REPLACES the
// accumulated chain, discarding arms that appear after it in document order.
// The builder resolves default position-independently (first matching
// non-default arm wins, default only as fallback).
// Arms are distinguished by tile width: <=2 -> 10px, default -> 12px, >=8 -> 14px.
#switchDefaultOrder programmable(n:int=5) {
  @switch(n) {
    <= 2: bitmap(generated(color(10, 10, #FF0000)));
    default: bitmap(generated(color(12, 12, #00FF00)));
    >= 8: bitmap(generated(color(14, 14, #0000FF)));
  }
}
